<title>USA: Alco Standard to post Q1 charge.</title>
<headline>Alco Standard to post Q1 charge.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY FORGE, Pa. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alco Standard Corp said Tuesday it would book an extraordinary charge in the first quarter of about $19 million to cover premiums associated with early debt payment.</p>
<p>Alco said it will use its $550 million inter-company debt repayment from the spin-off of Unisource, its paper and supplies distribution business, to aggressively pay off public and private debt and reduce interest costs.</p>
</text>
